= Dobbs

The Supreme Court overturns Roe v. Wade. Abortion is now a state-by-state fight. For the first time in a generation, many Democratic voters feel an urgent reason to turn out.

- @legislate: Push for national legislation.
- @ballot: Take the fight to state ballot measures.

@legislate
subtitle: Likely to fail, but clarifies the stakes.
on-arrival: enthusiasm += 3; prog_dissent -= 3; pop_mod += 0.2

The bill fails in the Senate. The campaign is on.

@ballot
subtitle: Wins where it counts.
on-arrival: pop_mod += 0.4; stability += 1; enthusiasm += 2

Referendums in several states show the issue is more popular than many expected.
